{"3661980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raccoon Crime Spree", "steam_appid": 3661980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661980/extras/e4001667ab4aa48face315858218c097.avif?t=1784163140\" width=550 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <i>Official Selection – Short Games Showcase 2025</i><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Raccoon Crime Spree</strong> is a chaotic mischief-sandbox where you play a raccoon unleashing anarchy on a small city!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661980/extras/Gif_1_narrow_optimized.gif?t=1784163140\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snatch donuts from  cops, hijack taxis for joyrides, dunk burgers in fountains, and bop pesky pedestrians just because you can. Wreak havoc in parks, alleys, and drive-thrus—then make a slick getaway by diving into dumpsters or skateboarding through traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're tipping trash cans or stealing pizza, every bit of mischief fuels your personal crime spree. The more chaos you cause, the funnier—and wilder—it gets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong>, a cunning raccoon with a gift for getting into trouble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clueless city</strong> full of fast food, trash piles, and prank-ready pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless cops</strong> who’ll chase you down—unless you outsmart them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxis, skateboards, and trucks</strong> to steal for your next great escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mischief-powered mayhem</strong> that keeps escalating the more you play.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raccoon Chaos Awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661980/extras/Gif_2_Narrow_optimized.gif?t=1784163140\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661980/extras/e4001667ab4aa48face315858218c097.avif?t=1784163140\" width=550 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <i>Official Selection – Short Games Showcase 2025</i><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Raccoon Crime Spree</strong> is a chaotic mischief-sandbox where you play a raccoon unleashing anarchy on a small city!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661980/extras/Gif_1_narrow_optimized.gif?t=1784163140\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snatch donuts from  cops, hijack taxis for joyrides, dunk burgers in fountains, and bop pesky pedestrians just because you can. Wreak havoc in parks, alleys, and drive-thrus—then make a slick getaway by diving into dumpsters or skateboarding through traffic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're tipping trash cans or stealing pizza, every bit of mischief fuels your personal crime spree. The more chaos you cause, the funnier—and wilder—it gets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong>, a cunning raccoon with a gift for getting into trouble.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A clueless city</strong> full of fast food, trash piles, and prank-ready pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless cops</strong> who’ll chase you down—unless you outsmart them!</p></li><li><p clas